{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_015_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96ef399695d72adb0f09877fd26af0e5b84c075c25c8ecbc6591b9a6b93fbc03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c9823db7f65e470506407582599bdf2c3b6701eede6109dc19f8955d6ad7750",
      "text": "好——！多亏了制作人，\n我充满干劲了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7417dd2708bad1a250a76b389351c6544ae5aa3d56ea999d365224fbda9e3dc0",
      "text": "我一定会好好宣传\n这款爽肤水和乳液的魅力与功效的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e695f10e65ab9291380e0e44180001947d216fa6985c2e634e8ca19d0de8f92e",
      "text": "就是这股气势，龙先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:872fe082279eff5af360c6a875c323f892295d41301cf8b02dd01cf21deafb74",
      "text": "头发固然重要，\n但偶像的肌肤也很重要啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc8a6ceda7b229b306f9823d07c297a0ad1dc227271c234813a65dc66e31ea3",
      "text": "毕竟这是要面对许多人的工作，\n不仅是头发，皮肤也得好好保养才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf6be698f108329c5f6a52113930861dabefbc2b727e6a6170f77419bf017fe",
      "text": "好……为了回应客户的期待，\n我一定要把可靠男人的概念演到底！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee805ecb36ffe4b59644a24c26aa9c87225f60ae95fd9cc574d50b5b9d874cf6",
      "text": "好的，龙先生的话绝对能做到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91cc4cb754073d4d9c45f14a38dc0f761e993e7a2c48e4aebe729fd595da1d5c",
      "text": "还有……就算将来我真的秃了，\n我也要做好坦然接受的准备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09fc76692710efb148d9bf07e0f37e846967a9d77a8420029aac735a5611bc7b",
      "text": "要是哪天我也变成老爸那样，到那时候生发剂的\n广告也尽管交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ebc4c536bd71bc5bc0d21ac27fb777aa6dbda6cff0f43742f7cdd6d7050621",
      "text": "制作人，你就看着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
